                        <div id="article-summary" style="display: none">
                            <h3><img src="/redesign2010/img/publishing/icons/summarize.svg" alt="" />Summary for: Czech news in brief for August 11: Tuesday's top afternoon headlines</h3>
                            <ul>
                                                            <li>Czechia warns registered travelers after Colombia earthquake kills at least 164 people.</li>
                                                            <li>July inflation rose to 1.7 percent, remaining among Europe's lowest rates.</li>
                                                            <li>Authorities seek 40,000 users for eDoklady stress test before autumn municipal elections.</li>
                                                            <li>Heat Waves tool now provides city-level heat stress forecasts across Czechia.</li>
                                                            <li>Czech sports drama Invincible receives English dub and planned US release.</li>
                                                        </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    
                    
                    
                                            <div class="table-of-content extra-margin">
                                                    <ul>
                                                            <li data-toc-target="2071197">
                                    <img src="/redesign2010/img/publishing/scroll.svg" alt="" />Czechia issues warnings for Colombia travel
                                </li>
                                                            <li data-toc-target="2071199">
                                    <img src="/redesign2010/img/publishing/scroll.svg" alt="" />Czech inflation edges up to 5th-lowest
                                </li>
                                                            <li data-toc-target="2071200">
                                    <img src="/redesign2010/img/publishing/scroll.svg" alt="" />Digital ID app opens to public stress test
                                </li>
                                                            <li data-toc-target="2071202">
                                    <img src="/redesign2010/img/publishing/scroll.svg" alt="" />Heat stress tool now tracks Czech cities
                                </li>
                                                            <li data-toc-target="2071211">
                                    <img src="/redesign2010/img/publishing/scroll.svg" alt="" />'Invincible' gets English dub for US run
                                </li>
                                                        </ul>
                                                </div>
                    
                    <div id="expats-article-content" class="content">
                        <div class="widget text" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><div class="text-wrapper "><p><em>A magnitude-7.4 earthquake in Colombia has killed at least 164 people, and the Czech Foreign Ministry is urging registered travelers to stay clear of affected areas. Closer to home, July inflation ticked up to 1.7 percent, still among the lowest in Europe, and the state is asking citizens to help stress-test the glitch-prone eDoklady app before autumn's municipal vote. Here's what's happening now.</em></p></div></div><div class="widget headinglevel1" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><h2>This evening&#039;s top story</h2></div><div class="widget headinglevel2" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><h3 class="xcontent" data-toc="2071197">Czechia issues warnings for Colombia travel</h3></div>	<div class="eas no-1">
		<a href="/czech-news/article/expatscz-advertising?utm_source=expatscz&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=house-ads-advertisemenu"
								class="top-right" 
								target="_blank">Advertisement</a>
		<a href="https://www.expats.cz/jobs/?utm_source=expatscz&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=expatscz" 
		    class="eas-link"
				data-eas-1="2402"
	data-eas-2="49"
			 target="_blank" >
			<picture>
<source srcset="/images/amedia/2402/mobile/840x500-expatscz-jobs-2025-list-var-1-jwmsbp.webp" media="(max-width: 840px)" />
<img src="/images/amedia/2402/desktop/840x250-expatscz-jobs-2025-list-var-1-ynvmvw.webp"  alt="Expats.cz Jobs 2025 list var 1" /></picture>

		</a>
		
	</div>
	<style>	@media(max-width: 840px) {
		.eas.no-1 a.eas-link img {
			width: 100% !important;
			display: block;
		}
	}</style><div class="widget text" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><div class="text-wrapper "><p>The Czech Foreign Ministry has told citizens registered in Colombia not to travel to areas hit by Monday's magnitude-7.4 earthquake, which has killed at least 164 people with the toll expected to rise. Some 45 Czech travelers are currently registered in the country through the ministry's Drozd system, and none had contacted the emergency hotline as of today. President Petr Pavel sent condolences to Colombia's government and praised rescue workers searching for people trapped under collapsed buildings.</p></div></div><div class="widget text" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><div class="text-wrapper "><p><strong>Getting help: </strong>Czechs in Colombia can reach the embassy in Bogotá during business hours or call the Foreign Ministry's 24-hour emergency line at +420 222 420 222.</p></div></div><div class="widget articlelink" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18">	<div class="article-link">
		<strong>RECOMMENDED ARTICLE</strong>
		<div class="article">
				<a href="/czech-news/article/venezuelans-in-prague-protest-disputed-election-results" data-cwid="2071206" data-cwiad="88818" data-cu="/czech-news/article/venezuelans-in-prague-protest-disputed-election-results"  target="_blank">
		<img src="/images/publishing/articles/2024/08/320_214/venezuelan-protest-in-prague-on-july-28-photo-la-casa-venezolana-icfnx.webp" alt="Venezuelan protest in Prague on July 28. Photo: La Casa Venezolana" />
	</a>
			<div class="info">
				<h3><a href="/czech-news/article/venezuelans-in-prague-protest-disputed-election-results" data-cwid="2071206" data-cwiad="88818" data-cu="/czech-news/article/venezuelans-in-prague-protest-disputed-election-results"  target="_blank">Venezuelans in Prague continue series of protests following disputed election</a></h3>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div></div><div class="widget headinglevel1" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><h2>More top headlines</h2></div><div class="widget headinglevel2" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><h3 class="xcontent" data-toc="2071199">Czech inflation edges up to 5th-lowest</h3></div><div class="widget text" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><div class="text-wrapper "><p>Consumer prices rose 1.7 percent year-on-year in July, up from 1.5 percent in June, driven by fuel costs while falling food prices offset the increase. That still left Czechia with the <a href="https://www.ceskenoviny.cz/zpravy/analyza-cr-si-v-zebricku-inflace-mirne-pohorsila-mela-ji-v-evrope-5-nejnizs/2860634" data-cwid="2071188" data-cwiad="88818" data-cu="https://www.ceskenoviny.cz/zpravy/analyza-cr-si-v-zebricku-inflace-mirne-pohorsila-mela-ji-v-evrope-5-nejnizs/2860634" target="_blank">fifth-lowest inflation rate</a> among 42 countries tracked, behind only Sweden, Switzerland, Liechtenstein and one other economy, though every neighboring country posted higher inflation than Czechia.</p></div></div>	<div class="eas no-2">
		<a href="/czech-news/article/expatscz-advertising?utm_source=expatscz&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=house-ads-advertisemenu"
								class="top-right" 
								target="_blank">Advertisement</a>
		<a href="https://www.berlitz.com/en-cz/lp/learn-with-berlitz?utm_source=expats.cz&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=promo_2026&utm_term=foreigners-prague&utm_content=Expats-final" 
		    class="eas-link"
				data-eas-1="2907"
	data-eas-2="49"
			 target="_blank" >
			<picture>
<source srcset="/images/amedia/2907/mobile/840x500-berlitz-inarticle-banner-uaomxv.webp" media="(max-width: 840px)" />
<img src="/images/amedia/2907/desktop/840x250-berlitz-inarticle-banner-tbqipn.webp"  alt="Berlitz in-article banner" /></picture>

		</a>
		
	</div>
	<style>	@media(max-width: 840px) {
		.eas.no-2 a.eas-link img {
			width: 100% !important;
			display: block;
		}
	}</style><div class="widget text" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><div class="text-wrapper "><p><strong>Under the hood:</strong> Core inflation is running just under 3 percent, and analysts expect the headline rate to climb toward 2–3 percent by year's end as service prices keep rising.</p></div></div><div class="widget articlelink" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18">	<div class="article-link">
		<strong>RECOMMENDED ARTICLE</strong>
		<div class="article">
				<a href="/czech-news/article/price-czech-what-s-surprisingly-expensive-in-prague-and-what-s-still-a-bargain" data-cwid="2071207" data-cwiad="88818" data-cu="/czech-news/article/price-czech-what-s-surprisingly-expensive-in-prague-and-what-s-still-a-bargain"  target="_blank">
		<img src="/images/publishing/articles/2026/08/320_214/created-with-pictures-from-shutterstock-zshsl.webp" alt="Created with pictures from Shutterstock" />
	</a>
			<div class="info">
				<h3><a href="/czech-news/article/price-czech-what-s-surprisingly-expensive-in-prague-and-what-s-still-a-bargain" data-cwid="2071207" data-cwiad="88818" data-cu="/czech-news/article/price-czech-what-s-surprisingly-expensive-in-prague-and-what-s-still-a-bargain"  target="_blank">Analysis: What does it really cost to live in Prague in 2026?</a></h3>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div></div><div class="widget headinglevel2" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><h3 class="xcontent" data-toc="2071200">Digital ID app opens to public stress test Thursday</h3></div><div class="widget text" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><div class="text-wrapper "><p>The Interior Ministry and Digital Information Agency <a href="https://www.ceskenoviny.cz/zpravy/-lide-se-mohou-ve-ctvrtek-zapojit-do-verejneho-testu-aplikace-edoklady/2860723" data-cwid="2071191" data-cwiad="88818" data-cu="https://www.ceskenoviny.cz/zpravy/-lide-se-mohou-ve-ctvrtek-zapojit-do-verejneho-testu-aplikace-edoklady/2860723" target="_blank">are inviting eDoklady users</a> to log in simultaneously at 1 p.m. Thursday, aiming to replicate the surge that crashed the app during last year's parliamentary elections. Officials hope for around 40,000 participants, roughly the turnout expected for municipal elections this fall.</p></div></div><div class="widget text" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><div class="text-wrapper "><p><strong>Before you test: </strong>Users are asked to update to the latest app version and confirm their PIN in advance, since forgotten PINs, not technical failures, caused most problems in earlier trial rounds.</p></div></div><div class="widget articlelink" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18">	<div class="article-link">
		<strong>RECOMMENDED ARTICLE</strong>
		<div class="article">
				<a href="/czech-news/article/no-need-for-physical-cards-czechia-to-introduce-digital-id-from-2024" data-cwid="2071215" data-cwiad="88818" data-cu="/czech-news/article/no-need-for-physical-cards-czechia-to-introduce-digital-id-from-2024"  target="_blank">
		<img src="/images/publishing/articles/2023/09/320_214/photo-via-istock-by-miniseries-tcpvq.webp" alt="Photo via iStock by miniseries" />
	</a>
			<div class="info">
				<h3><a href="/czech-news/article/no-need-for-physical-cards-czechia-to-introduce-digital-id-from-2024" data-cwid="2071215" data-cwiad="88818" data-cu="/czech-news/article/no-need-for-physical-cards-czechia-to-introduce-digital-id-from-2024"  target="_blank">Czechia improves citizen convenience with brand new digital ID</a></h3>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div></div><div class="widget headinglevel1" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><h2>News you can use</h2></div><div class="widget headinglevel2" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><h3 class="xcontent" data-toc="2071202">Heat stress tool now tracks Czech cities</h3></div>	<div class="eas no-3">
		<a href="/czech-news/article/expatscz-advertising?utm_source=expatscz&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=house-ads-advertisemenu"
								class="top-right" 
								target="_blank">Advertisement</a>
		<a href="https://www.czechbusinessguide.com/get-the-guide/?utm_source=expatscz&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=expatscz" 
		    class="eas-link"
				data-eas-1="2708"
	data-eas-2="49"
			 target="_blank" >
			<picture>
<source srcset="/images/amedia/2708/mobile/840x500-czech-business-guide-october-2025-jkjaqj.webp" media="(max-width: 840px)" />
<img src="/images/amedia/2708/desktop/840x250-czech-business-guide-october-2025-igxera.webp"  alt="Czech business Guide October 2025" /></picture>

		</a>
		
	</div>
	<style>	@media(max-width: 840px) {
		.eas.no-3 a.eas-link img {
			width: 100% !important;
			display: block;
		}
	}</style><div class="widget text" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><div class="text-wrapper "><p>The Heat Waves<a href="https://www.vlny-veder.cz/" data-cwid="2071194" data-cwiad="88818" data-cu="https://www.vlny-veder.cz/" target="_blank"> monitoring site </a>now breaks down heat stress by individual Czech city rather than just region, letting residents check local conditions and a nine-day forecast. As of today, conditions are moderate nationwide, a step down from Monday's severe stress levels in Moravia and the Elbe region.</p></div></div><div class="widget text" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><div class="text-wrapper "><p><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Tropical nights, when temperatures stay above 20°C, are especially hard on the body since they block natural cooling, so the city-level tool is aimed partly at helping vulnerable residents plan around specific local risk.</p></div></div><div class="widget headinglevel1" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><h2>ICYMI</h2></div><div class="widget headinglevel2" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><h3 class="xcontent" data-toc="2071211">&#039;Invincible&#039; gets English dub for US run</h3></div><div class="widget text" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><div class="text-wrapper "><p>The Czech sports drama Invincible, based on the 2019 Para Hockey World Championship in Ostrava, is getting an English dub and a US release through distributor Highland Film Group. Producer Petr Jákl says the film, which drew over 155,000 Czech moviegoers and a wide Netflix audience, has real tools to reach American viewers, including Hollywood actor Til Schweiger.</p></div></div><div class="widget text" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><div class="text-wrapper "><p><strong>Oscar angle: </strong>Invincible is also one of five finalists in the running to become Czechia's official Best Foreign Language Film submission, with the pick due Aug.19.</p></div></div>	<div class="eas no-4">
		<a href="/czech-news/article/expatscz-advertising?utm_source=expatscz&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=house-ads-advertisemenu"
								class="top-right" 
								target="_blank">Advertisement</a>
		<a href="https://icolonnade.cz/pojisteni-cizincu/?utm_source=Expats.cz&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=studenti_prazdniny_2026" 
		    class="eas-link"
				data-eas-1="3363"
	data-eas-2="49"
			 target="_blank" >
			<picture>
<source srcset="/images/amedia/3363/mobile/840x500-colonnade-insurance-summer-2026-category-in-article-list-tdsktr.webp" media="(max-width: 840px)" />
<img src="/images/amedia/3363/desktop/840x250-colonnade-insurance-summer-2026-category-in-article-list-jgzgho.webp"  alt="Colonnade Insurance summer 2026 category in article & list" /></picture>

		</a>
		
	</div>
	<style>	@media(max-width: 840px) {
		.eas.no-4 a.eas-link img {
			width: 100% !important;
			display: block;
		}
	}</style><div class="widget text" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18"><div class="text-wrapper highlight"><p><strong>DAILY POLL RESULTS </strong>With Kasárna Karlín expanding and Letná’s Stalin site reopening, we asked readers what Prague needs more of when it comes to cultural hangouts. Outdoor cultural spaces were the clear favorite, with 48 percent of the 142 votes. Affordable concert venues came second at 25 percent, followed by community cultural centers at 15 percent. Independent cinemas and contemporary art spaces each received 6 percent, while small theaters received no votes.</p></div></div><div class="widget articlelink" data-generated-at="2026-08-12 19:10:18">	<div class="article-link">
		<strong>RECOMMENDED ARTICLE</strong>
		<div class="article">
				<a href="/czech-news/article/prague-approves-czk-1-9-billion-renovation-of-karlin-barracks" data-cwid="2071214" data-cwiad="88818" data-cu="/czech-news/article/prague-approves-czk-1-9-billion-renovation-of-karlin-barracks"  target="_blank">
		<img src="/images/publishing/articles/2026/08/320_214/tak-architects-kvmmi.webp" alt="TaK Architects" />
	</a>
			<div class="info">
				<h3><a href="/czech-news/article/prague-approves-czk-1-9-billion-renovation-of-karlin-barracks" data-cwid="2071214" data-cwiad="88818" data-cu="/czech-news/article/prague-approves-czk-1-9-billion-renovation-of-karlin-barracks"  target="_blank">PHOTOS: Prague's rebuilt Karlín Barracks se to transform the neighborhood</a></h3>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="article-content-end"></div>

                    
